          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775805563246_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "input_data: {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_TASK_IN_USER_COLLECTION.$output}}\ndeeplink: {{$context.$nodes.GENERATE_TASK_DEEP_LINK.$output}}\nName : {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_TASK_DATA.$output.result.taskName}}\n\nRespond with a confirmation message that the task has been added.\n\nInclude a clickable deep link using \"Click Here\" as the anchor text.\n\nMessage format:\nTask {Name} has been created successfully.'<a href=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>'\n\n**Deep Links:** Extract the link from the deeplink data. Wrap the \"Click Here\" with a valid anchor tag (`<a href=\"...\" target=\"_blank\">Name</a>`).\n\nReturn the full message with the anchor tag included. Do not return only the anchor tag. Deeplink for the new task has to be displayed compulsorily. \n\n\n\n{{$context.$nodes.CREATE_TASK_IN_USER_COLLECTION.$error.$info}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
